{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"櫻坂46の井上梨名です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月9日発売　「BOMB」さんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"増本綺良と登場しています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テーマは誕生日パーティー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1月生まれの二人の誕生日パーティーを開いて頂きました！\n可愛いケーキに、たくさんのお菓子！\n楽しかったなー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きらちゃんは撮影中、変な手の繋ぎ方をしてきたり、誕生日の帽子を変な感じに被せてきたり、面白かったです笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても楽しい撮影でした！\nありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、ご覧ください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ12DFKH429SWH934CMES731","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ12DGHTB6Q3EJ8CNK3Y82ZE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ12DHG2E3J4R8PK0BJ5QPYS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ12DJDGR7K9HP7DSSJ0AF0D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日、20時から放送"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テレビ朝日系「MUSIC STATION」 さんに、\n櫻坂46が出演させて頂きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「桜月」TV初披露になります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"24時59分からは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"para